   "file": "Q00022_TragedyInVonHellmannForest/31334-08.html",
   "quest": 22,
   "text": "Grand Magister Tifaren: Hunt zombies or ghosts in the Forest of the Dead for a clean skull, preferably an Elven one. It will increase my chances of summoning a priest of Einhasad to use a child of Shilen.",
   "header": "Grand Magister Tifaren",
